<title>UK: TABLE-VCI annual pre-tax profit rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-VCI annual pre-tax profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			    (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		19.5		   vs 17.3</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 5.5		    vs n/a</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 7.8		    vs 7.1</p>
<p> Pretax		     9.05		   vs 8.03</p>
<p> Turnover		   98.2		   vs 76.6</p>
<p>Full company name - VCI Plc.</p>
<p>NOTE - VCI is a cross-media publishing group. Chairman Michael Grade said the opportunities for further growth were &quot;numerous and exciting&quot; and that 1997 had begun encouragingly.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
